<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Orchestral arrangement (Thomas Tycho)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1984</span><span class="sg-chain-h">arrangement, the one most often played</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Christian schools' version (Ruth Ponniah)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1988</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new second verse</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Dharug-language versions (Jacqueline Troy; Richard Green)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2003; 2010</span><span class="sg-chain-h">translation</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Alternative lyrics (Judith Durham and Kutcha Edwards)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2009</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new words to the anthem</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Alternative lyrics (Peter Vickery, Recognition in Anthem Project)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2017</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new words to the anthem</span></li></ul></section>
